    "一次只能清理一个 URL 或一段纯文本，请减少所选内容后重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only one URL or one plain-text selection can be cleaned at a time. Reduce the selected content and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一次只能清理一个 URL 或一段纯文本，请减少所选内容后重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "与正则逐行对应；空行表示删除匹配内容。每一步结果都必须仍是 HTTP(S) URL。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Match replacements to regular expressions line by line; an empty line deletes the match. Every step must still produce an HTTP(S) URL."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "与正则逐行对应；空行表示删除匹配内容。每一步结果都必须仍是 HTTP(S) URL。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为避免明文请求，重定向解析不会访问初始 http:// 链接。请使用 https:// 链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "To avoid a cleartext request, redirect resolution will not access an initial http:// link. Use an https:// link instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "为避免明文请求，重定向解析不会访问初始 http:// 链接。请使用 https:// 链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
