    "本说明与 GitHub 仓库根目录的 PRIVACY.md 同步。如果新功能会传输或保留 URL、分享文本、诊断或使用数据，必须先更新说明。可通过仓库 Issues 反馈，请勿附带私密链接或个人信息。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This notice is kept in sync with PRIVACY.md at the root of the GitHub repository. If a new feature will transmit or retain URLs, shared text, diagnostics, or usage data, the notice must be updated first. You can provide feedback through repository Issues; do not include private links or personal information."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本说明与 GitHub 仓库根目录的 PRIVACY.md 同步。如果新功能会传输或保留 URL、分享文本、诊断或使用数据，必须先更新说明。可通过仓库 Issues 反馈，请勿附带私密链接或个人信息。"
          }
