    "重定向规则": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redirect Rules"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重定向规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重定向规则是联网许可列表。命中后，主 App、“使用 Nothung 复制”和键盘可见期间的自动捕捉流程会跟随最多五次 HTTPS 跳转，再清理最终链接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Redirect rules are a network allowlist. When one matches, the main app, Copy with Nothung, and automatic capture while the keyboard is visible follow up to five HTTPS redirects, then clean the final link."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重定向规则是联网许可列表。命中后，主 App、“使用 Nothung 复制”和键盘可见期间的自动捕捉流程会跟随最多五次 HTTPS 跳转，再清理最终链接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "重定向解析器的超时设置无效。": {
